&_nc_oc=AdrOORqD_-r8mXvUdSbNmv-xZS8FNMMkXLCXCxnPHm14jR7r8qxDp9_3e0-vrQXLz7Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCDYJvLEsUDvJzuZpI441_0WcnjC_l6WhNwndrgSUif1A&oe=6A4923BE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5JdumKcI88wQ7kNvwHPlE7w&_nc_oc=AdpDAbafYVqwUElIIXArCWxnoD01YSs90zdW8ErUxlc0zMYA20203kzIX9lZ00tRF6I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCHAf_L4p-QLXeNxevBvqwvjMkaOt-fcbJjM5A3INaTlw&oe=6A48FC7C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vQxgk1oOfhkQ7kNvwEgsl1A&_nc_oc=AdrRFmcREZpIY0oSz-DuqJdpvslBftCLfSc6t2gkjV7oyJl4GVYNcVBvOiye1TXAyOY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBYLlRjM-Adep0AXRs-dPSfV5zeoftYNa7eZjjbZIW8Tw&oe=6A491B07"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2y2RD-mCUpYQ7kNvwFXa2HO&_nc_oc=AdrJ1e3l-DyC_MJBIkiphk1weuXOTh3Wogub7pfA8f8GXQamY9gk6b8_tih1p2CLkU4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCPg3AuZG_BXsPNzQoUeHX5ssd5EVMWmK3dKm9wZ1JA7w&oe=6A4906D5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U9F5LNsKp6EQ7kNvwEdBi1u&_nc_oc=AdpMYwDrDljpo3Hi3qJxnLNApjJQP3FMGUjeZSTWdnUs4_DAuoQuKZtxkfVHlzXol_8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCQwxdgxMmFEAu-LZcu9CqHGIXPJYsFKhJg-srJ2v4Q6g&oe=6A491364"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.